2. Users service + `/users/me` routes.
3. Task create/update paths stamp + serialize audit actors.
4. Task UI: Due date label + read-only audit fields.
5. Settings Profile section.
6. Smoke QA on DEV (`:5173` / API `:3001`); leave PROD finish-up for user “finish up”.

